  (text "R9 DNP: fit 120 ohm only at physical CAN bus ends.\nJ2.1 is +5 V POWER INPUT for a powered programming clip.\nDo not connect a programmer VTREF pin to J2.1.\nY1 ESR80/CL12, C13/C14 must be qualified on prototype.\nAbsolute angle requires two-track calibration and firmware."
